<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Dry weather seen over most of Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Dry weather seen over most of Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Thursday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    0</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecasts dry weather over the island except for a few showers in the southwestern coastal areas.</p>
</text>
